RetroDev Studio - Third-Party and Distribution Notice
=====================================================

This repository builds a desktop application and can provision external development
toolchains into a user-local cache. Toolchains, Libretro cores, commercial ROMs and
BYOR corpora are not bundled in RetroDev Studio release packages.

Application dependency inventory
--------------------------------

The complete machine-readable inventory is generated by:

    npm run security:licenses

Output: src-tauri/target-test/validation/license-inventory.json

The inventory is derived from package-lock.json, Cargo.lock/cargo metadata and the
immutable host requirements manifest. Original copyright and license files remain
authoritative.

