Release policy
--------------

- Public release is blocked while signing and updater keys are not configured.
- The updater plugin and updater artifacts remain disabled.
- Internal unsigned packages must be identified as internal and must not include
  cached toolchains, Libretro cores, commercial ROMs or BYOR material.
- This notice is an engineering inventory, not legal advice. Upstream license text
  controls whenever this summary and an upstream package disagree.
